{
  "tabs": [
    {
      "id": "declare",
      "name": "1. Declare the tool",
      "sub": "",
      "note": "Same JSON Schema. OpenAI wraps it in `{type, function}` and calls it `parameters`. Anthropic calls it `input_schema`.",
      "panes": [
        {
          "label": "OpenAI-compatible",
          "file": "tools[0]",
          "lang": "json",
          "src": "{\n  \"type\": \"function\",\n  \"function\": {\n    \"name\": \"get_weather\",\n    \"description\": \"Get the current weather for a city.\",\n    \"parameters\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"city\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"city\"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}",
          "hl": [
            2,
            3,
            6
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Anthropic",
          "file": "tools[0]",
          "lang": "json",
          "src": "{\n  \"name\": \"get_weather\",\n  \"description\": \"Get the current weather for a city.\",\n  \"input_schema\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"city\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\n      \"city\"\n    ]\n  }\n}",
          "hl": [
            4
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ask",
      "name": "2. Model asks for it",
      "sub": "",
      "note": "OpenAI puts calls in `tool_calls`, and `arguments` is a **string**. Anthropic puts a `tool_use` block in `content`, and `input` is an **object**.",
      "panes": [
        {
          "label": "OpenAI-compatible",
          "file": "choices[0]",
          "lang": "json",
          "src": "{\n  \"message\": {\n    \"role\": \"assistant\",\n    \"content\": null,\n    \"tool_calls\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"call_1\",\n        \"type\": \"function\",\n        \"function\": {\n          \"name\": \"get_weather\",\n          \"arguments\": \"{\\\"city\\\": \\\"Tokyo\\\"}\"\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"finish_reason\": \"tool_calls\"\n}",
          "hl": [
            5,
            11,
            16
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Anthropic",
          "file": "response",
          "lang": "json",
          "src": "{\n  \"stop_reason\": \"tool_use\",\n  \"content\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"tool_use\",\n      \"id\": \"toolu_01A\",\n      \"name\": \"get_weather\",\n      \"input\": {\n        \"city\": \"Tokyo\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}",
          "hl": [
            2,
            5,
            8
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "result",
      "name": "3. Send the result",
      "sub": "",
      "note": "OpenAI has a `tool` role, one message per result. Anthropic has no tool role: results go in a **user** message, all together, as `tool_result` blocks.",
      "panes": [
        {
          "label": "OpenAI-compatible",
          "file": "messages (appended)",
          "lang": "json",
          "src": "[\n  {\n    \"role\": \"assistant\",\n    \"content\": null,\n    \"tool_calls\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"call_1\",\n        \"type\": \"function\",\n        \"function\": {\n          \"name\": \"get_weather\",\n          \"arguments\": \"{\\\"city\\\": \\\"Tokyo\\\"}\"\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"role\": \"tool\",\n    \"tool_call_id\": \"call_1\",\n    \"content\": \"{\\\"temp\\\": 22, \\\"sky\\\": \\\"rain\\\"}\"\n  }\n]",
          "hl": [
            17,
            18
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Anthropic",
          "file": "messages (appended)",
          "lang": "json",
          "src": "[\n  {\n    \"role\": \"assistant\",\n    \"content\": [\n      {\n        \"type\": \"tool_use\",\n        \"id\": \"toolu_01A\",\n        \"name\": \"get_weather\",\n        \"input\": {\n          \"city\": \"Tokyo\"\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"role\": \"user\",\n    \"content\": [\n      {\n        \"type\": \"tool_result\",\n        \"tool_use_id\": \"toolu_01A\",\n        \"content\": \"{\\\"temp\\\": 22, \\\"sky\\\": \\\"rain\\\"}\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]",
          "hl": [
            16,
            19,
            20
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
